    {
      "Id": 1040220037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "媒体评价相当不错。/n就连一向毒舌的《Future Dai Star》专栏都夸我们了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402200300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40603,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "406"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040220038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“在剧团电姬之中，本巢的存在一直过于强大。能够维持平衡并非奇迹，/n　而是努力的成果。尽管那努力的方向并不能说是正确……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402200310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "406"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040220039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“然而剧团本身的成长，或许终于为本巢指明了理想的前路。/n　其证明，正是《爱丽丝梦游仙境》。”――他们这么写。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402200320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "406"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040220040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "根津真知子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……提醒她，别让她得意忘形。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402200330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40701,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "407"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040220041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不可能吧。《爱丽丝》的周边现在几乎全都追加生产。/n而且我们这些孩子也都在说“成功全是叶羽的功劳”，一个劲把她捧上天。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402200340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
